#: ../lib/recovery-mode/recovery-menu:26
#, sh-format
msgid "   Resume normal boot"
msgstr "   Eg agzul amagnu n usenker"

#: ../lib/recovery-mode/recovery-menu:47
#, sh-format
msgid ""
"You are now going to exit the recovery mode and continue the boot sequence. "
"Please note that some graphic drivers require a full graphical boot and so "
"will fail when resuming from recovery.\n"
"If that's the case, simply reboot from the login screen and then perform a "
"standard boot."
msgstr ""
"Aql-ak·akem tura ad teffɣeḍ seg uskar n tririt syen ad tkemmleḍ tagzemt n "
"usenker. Ẓer belli kra n yinuḍaf n wudlifen sran asenker udlif ummid ad "
"rrẓen mi ara yalsen tiririt.\n"
"Ma yella akka i yella lḥal, ales asenker seg ugdil kan n unekcum syen selkem "
"asenker aslugan."

#: ../lib/recovery-mode/recovery-menu:67
#, sh-format
msgid ""
"Continuing will remount your / filesystem in read/write mode and mount any "
"other filesystem defined in /etc/fstab.\n"
"Do you wish to continue?"
msgstr ""
"Ma yella tkemmleḍ i wallus n usali n unagraw-inek·inem n yifuyla / deg uskar "
"n tɣuri/tira, daɣen ad d-isali yal anagraw-nniḍen n yifuyla yettusbadun deg "
"/etc/fstab.\n"
"Tebɣiḍ ad tkemmleḍ?"

#: ../lib/recovery-mode/recovery-menu:95
#, sh-format
msgid ""
"The option you selected requires your filesystem to be in read-only mode. "
"Unfortunately another option you selected earlier, made you exit this mode.\n"
"The easiest way of getting back in read-only mode is to reboot your system."
msgstr ""
"Taxtiṛit i d-tferneḍ tesra anagraw-inek·inem n yifuyla ad yili deg uskar n "
"tɣuri kan. Nesḥassef, taxtiṛit-nniḍen i tferneḍ yakan tsuffeɣ-ik·ikem seg "
"uskar-a.\n"
"Abrid i isehlen akk i tuɣalin ɣer uskar n tɣuri kan d allus n usenker n "
"unagraw-inek·inem."
